    "head_commit_message": "feat(formation): perception - a threatened group fights before it takes the downed\n\nFormationPerception.see gathers once a tick, before anything moves, the\nstanding hostile formations each formation detects and whether it is\nthreatened (Decision 134; spec 34 item 2). Pairs beyond either side's\nwidest sight are skipped on their bounds. FormationTaking reads it: a\nthreatened group sends no takers, calls back those out and doesn't hold.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcTW8o7t6QUEXUN9XNU6yv",
